{
    "word": "impalpable",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                "word": "impalpable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ee0ccf2a-adbd-410e-9ce6-06f89682a8b7",
                        "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more impalpable"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a0717c8a-cad1-44db-84de-6aca216a07e6",
                        "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most impalpable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c01b80d3-3723-3bcb-b058-1830fc1de806",
                        "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Incapable of being touched or felt; incorporeal, intangible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7dce17a3-df9b-41cd-854e-0aff52ff0350",
                                "sense_id": "c01b80d3-3723-3bcb-b058-1830fc1de806",
                                "text": "But here thou canst not handle aught, neither make the folk ware of thee, not though thou shout thy throat hoarse. For thou and I walk here impalpable and invisible, as it were two dreams walking."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d442aea4-7dca-3aa3-b54d-13b2ba6cf832",
                        "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not able to be perceived, or able to be perceived only with difficulty; insubstantial, thin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e514de90-3619-45eb-b5cd-dcd3f7e1cef2",
                                "sense_id": "d442aea4-7dca-3aa3-b54d-13b2ba6cf832",
                                "text": "On the benches lay figures covered with yellow linen, on which a fine and impalpable dust had gathered in the course of ages, but nothing like to the extent that one would have anticipated, for in these deep-hewn caves there is no material to turn to dust."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c26fb081-e1f9-334a-b7dc-5080440af90e",
                        "entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not easily grasped (mentally) or understood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4627d54b-050e-456e-b1b0-d8b8c2564116",
                                "sense_id": "c26fb081-e1f9-334a-b7dc-5080440af90e",
                                "text": "What is happiness, anyhow? Is this one of its hours, or the like of it?—so impalpable—a mere breath, an evanescent tinge?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bc4aa2e-3d88-4419-9e19-2b71ad9350df",
                                "sense_id": "c26fb081-e1f9-334a-b7dc-5080440af90e",
                                "text": "And I heard—him—it—this voice—other voices—all of them were so little more than voices—and the memory of that time itself lingers around me, impalpable, like a dying vibration of one immense jabber, silly, atrocious, sordid, savage, or simply mean, without any kind of sense."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46383691-fd15-4a03-be39-b3af62ce6d72",
                                "sense_id": "c26fb081-e1f9-334a-b7dc-5080440af90e",
                                "text": "She had an extraordinary sensitiveness to the impalpable elements of happiness, and as she walked at Darrow’s side her imagination flew back and forth, spinning luminous webs of feeling between herself and the scene about her."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34d66e30-491f-4a6f-aa12-d0c17b42cec0",
                        "source_entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "source_sense_description": "not perceivable",
                        "target_lang_word": "ongrijpbaar",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ongrijpbaar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d126f3ac-68f0-376e-995b-998202a1d4e8",
                                        "entry_id": "2a6909b3-7b14-3d5f-8c23-06be041ba766",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "niet te begrijpen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "935ff8fb-683a-457a-aa05-45924477727a",
                                                "sense_id": "d126f3ac-68f0-376e-995b-998202a1d4e8",
                                                "text": "Genie luisterde meer dan ze sprak, had iets ongrijpbaars, was moeilijk te doorgronden en liep het liefst helemaal alleen onder haar zilveren paraplu om de felle zon te vermijden."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c089628-2163-3734-ae16-8de1b5ffaf3f",
                                        "entry_id": "2a6909b3-7b14-3d5f-8c23-06be041ba766",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "wat niet helder en duidelijk te zien of te ervaren is en daardoor op meerdere manieren uitlegbaar"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "736c8186-8960-43d9-89c3-32d6a983a9da",
                                                "sense_id": "5c089628-2163-3734-ae16-8de1b5ffaf3f",
                                                "text": "De Gülenbeweging is ongrijpbaar en onbenaderbaar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc90bec3-9fcc-4873-9849-5dcae965987b",
                                                "sense_id": "5c089628-2163-3734-ae16-8de1b5ffaf3f",
                                                "text": "Dáárom zijn beelden als die van de dood van George Floyd zo krachtig. Ze maken het ongrijpbare tastbaar, brengen het oneerlijke systeem terug tot een hartverscheurend moment van onnodig menselijk leed. Tot een gezicht op het asfalt, een stem die maar blijft roepen dat hij geen adem kan krijgen. En niemand die luistert."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c606640-6219-4cfa-9a58-ded652d4ae31",
                                                "sense_id": "5c089628-2163-3734-ae16-8de1b5ffaf3f",
                                                "text": "Ze lijkt geen passies te hebben, behalve een voorliefde voor snuisterijen en een hele kennel vol honden, maar ook geen slechte eigenschappen, en wanneer ze koninklijke plechtigheden bijwoont, dwaalt haar blik af naar onzichtbare schouwspelen die alleen zij kan zien. Haar ongrijpbare karakter is als een blanco vel papier waarop je elk verhaal zou kunnen schrijven, en ieder meisje dat ervan droomt om prinses te worden, kan zich zonder problemen voorstellen dat ze in de beroemde kleine muiltjes van prinses Elfilda staat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "126727ae-0259-42a5-8d7a-18fa51076dc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "source_sense_description": "not perceivable",
                        "target_lang_word": "ontastbaar",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ontastbaar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "051000fd-17a7-30e7-b93d-f7226023dbaf",
                                        "entry_id": "4d4dd2b9-32c6-3a30-b63c-3a318b852252",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "niet duidelijk, niet concreet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88567e8c-9610-468a-80de-552c04929ac5",
                                                "sense_id": "051000fd-17a7-30e7-b93d-f7226023dbaf",
                                                "text": "- De façade van de organisatie, hun hardware, wekt makkelijk sympathie. Maar ondertussen kende niemand hun software, die ontastbaar was."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75ca72bc-e21d-419a-9404-24f86d3e173a",
                                                "sense_id": "051000fd-17a7-30e7-b93d-f7226023dbaf",
                                                "text": "- De effecten van cultuur op de economie zijn zeker aanwezig maar vaak ontastbaar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "648d39e1-a1c5-4105-a6d7-515e826d55db",
                        "source_entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
                        "source_sense_description": "not perceivable",
                        "target_lang_word": "impalpable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impalpable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21d279db-590f-3683-8e60-e1c81f24927e",
                                        "entry_id": "b7d443fb-2c63-3c4e-b7a0-46fd038ae097",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est si ténu, si fin, si délié, qu’il ne fait aucune impression sensible au toucher."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cebe26-d335-4c50-9ce9-4dbc99d1e553",
                                                "sense_id": "21d279db-590f-3683-8e60-e1c81f24927e",
                                                "text": "Mais la terre était réduite à l’état de poussière presque impalpable, et le sable continuait doucement à couler des dunes escarpées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5702fd03-dc59-4d02-8896-52177984a540",
                                                "sense_id": "21d279db-590f-3683-8e60-e1c81f24927e",
                                                "text": "Ou, plutôt, celui-ci s’est fantomisé, est devenu impalpable, immatériel, incorporel, comme les ombres qu’Ulysse rencontrait aux Enfers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8baeeef2-9880-48a4-a201-33e4047af201",
                                                "sense_id": "21d279db-590f-3683-8e60-e1c81f24927e",
                                                "text": "Dans l’air rafraîchi où une impalpable brume se condensait en rosée, les bêtes levèrent leur mufle humide […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ade6655-4524-47cc-9f7d-5b1535428c13",
                                                "sense_id": "21d279db-590f-3683-8e60-e1c81f24927e",
                                                "text": "Morange le regarda avec gravité. Ce morveux avait vu juste, depuis qu’Ahiga était parti, il ne cessait de penser à lui. Et plus le temps passait, plus cette douleur, sourde et impalpable, lui gâchait son humeur, et son existence. Et il n’était pas le seul que l’absence du gamin rendait apathique, Ma’iitsoh demeurait roulé en boule, toujours au même endroit, près du foyer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31006eda-af63-47f9-b869-77617110e464",
                        "source_entry_id": "630a0570-48b7-382a-a9a5-2499a0e54049",
